        "content": [
          {
            "content": [
              {
                "content": [
                  {
                    "text": "고친 e2e 13개: lock-bridge, set-scheme, opengym-muscle, opengym-summary, declutter-summary, set-table, sticky-bottom, app-distribution, app-continue, weighin-inbody-open, opengym-bodyweight, opengym-qa1, prefs-race.",
